| 0 | -3357.3 | -8378.23 | 32549.7 | 20000 |
| 1 | -24053.3 | 47468.5 | 326215 | 2500 |
| 2 | 38863.5 | -19339.7 | 230885 | 5000 |
| 3 | -4000 | -4000 | 45252.2 | 20000 |

**Cen 实测（6 区）**：

| idx | x | y | radius | transitionWidth |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 0 | -21011 | 8401.02 | 46134.6 | 5000 |
| 1 | -741.801 | 4141.73 | 74890.6 | 1500 |
